NOTE ON ARCHIVED DATA

Files under providers/, raw/, history/, and state/ are normalized or verbatim
reproductions of publicly published status information belonging to their
respective providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google). Those upstream payloads remain
the property of their publishers and are retained here for internal operational
forensics. The copyright claimed above applies to this project's own source
code, schema, and compilation of that data, not to the underlying provider
content.
